  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:02.196" end="00:03.696" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(GOONTEX)</p>
      <p begin="00:03.213" end="00:04.895" ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, ayy, pretty ass hoe can't</p>
      <p begin="00:04.895" end="00:07.152" ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, ayy, ayy</p>
      <p begin="00:07.152" end="00:10.912" ttm:agent="v1">Pretty ass hoe can't be herself so that's why she never get all of me</p>
      <p begin="00:10.912" end="00:14.434" ttm:agent="v1">I don't post drank when I do that shit, niggas know way better than calling me</p>
      <p begin="00:14.434" end="00:18.184" ttm:agent="v1">I was on xans and you knew that shit and you still wanna cry, that's flawed to me</p>
      <p begin="00:18.184" end="00:21.702" ttm:agent="v1">Need nobody, that's obviously, fan nigga turned to an opp on me</p>
      <p begin="00:21.702" end="00:25.236" ttm:agent="v1">Somebody plan on stopping me, let pops tell it, they be following me</p>
      <p begin="00:25.236" end="00:29.094" ttm:agent="v1">I just be hoping that God with me, can't trust that hoe but she raw to me</p>
      <p begin="00:29.094" end="00:32.851" ttm:agent="v1">She don't like getting in the car with me 'cause she gotta wake me up in the drivers seat</p>
      <p begin="00:32.851" end="00:36.364" ttm:agent="v1">Prolly got too much pride wit' me but I made that shit how it had to be</p>
      <p begin="00:36.364" end="00:40.132" ttm:agent="v1">Momma say too much cash wit' me, she don't know all the worst ones side wit' me</p>
      <p begin="00:40.132" end="00:43.645" ttm:agent="v1">Shit too easy, it had to be, I ran it up, made niggas mad at me</p>
      <p begin="00:43.645" end="00:47.434" ttm:agent="v1">Shit too easy to get too greasy and make everybody wanna side wit' me</p>
      <p begin="00:47.434" end="00:51.196" ttm:agent="v1">Said she need me and I need the one that's destined to make me sad again</p>
      <p begin="00:51.196" end="00:54.711" ttm:agent="v1">Gotta live fast 'cause it's happening, new drank made me rap again</p>
      <p begin="00:54.711" end="01:00.739" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Gotta live fast 'cause it's happening, new drank made me, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="01:00.739" end="01:06.008" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(No bap, ayy, ayy, ayy, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="01:06.008" end="01:09.520" ttm:agent="v1">Pretty ass hoe can't be herself so that's why she never get all of me</p>
      <p begin="01:09.520" end="01:13.035" ttm:agent="v1">I don't post drank when I do that shit, niggas know way better than calling me</p>
      <p begin="01:13.035" end="01:17.245" ttm:agent="v1">I was on xans and you knew that shit and you still wanna cry, that's flawed to me</p>
      <p begin="01:17.245" end="01:18.745" ttm:agent="v1">Haha</p>
      <p begin="01:18.580" end="01:22.580" ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, I need nobody, that's obviously</p>
